Archie: drop the nag infobars shown at startup.

Removes the "Google API keys are missing" infobar (Archie ships without
Google API keys on purpose) and the default-browser / pin-to-taskbar /
PDF-handler prompts. The crash-restore bubble and security warnings for
dangerous command-line flags are kept.

